  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  mysteriousMessages:
  - Static... can you hear me? Signal lost... adjusting...
  - Error... strange... unidentified pattern... noise...
  - Signal breaking... something’s wrong... decoding...
  - Frequency strange... off readings...
  mysteriousMessages2:
  - not...natural...quake...
  - quake...decay...labs...critical...unstable...
  - Core breach... dangerous levels... evacuate
  mysteriousMessages3:
  - explosion...reactor...r...r...radioactive...
  - No one left... explosion... instability... danger!
  - radioactive...reaction...leak...dangerous
  finalMessage: The earthquake you felt was not a natural earthquake. It was the power plant in the desert exploding! We are in desperate need of your help. I will send you the exact coordinates of the explosion site.
